stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Empty: page shows prompt to search
  Empty --> Validating: Search pressed
  Validating --> FieldErrors: missing subject or bad course number
  FieldErrors --> Validating: Search pressed again
  Validating --> Waiting: valid query
  Waiting --> Skeletons: still waiting after 100 ms
  Waiting --> Results: response under 100 ms
  Skeletons --> Results: sections found
  Skeletons --> NoMatches: zero sections
  Skeletons --> LoadError: service failed
  LoadError --> Waiting: Try again
  NoMatches --> Waiting: Clear filters
  Results --> Results: Add or Remove (instant, announced)
